>The spectrum of cardiovascular disease in the Marfan syndrome: a clinico-morphologic study of 18 necropsy patients and comparison to 151 previously reported necropsy patients</article-title><source>Am Heart J</source><year>1982</year><volume>104</volume><fpage>115</fpage><lpage>135</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7046406</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0002-8703(82)90650-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hirata</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Triposkiadis</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Sparks</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Bowen</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Wooley</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name><name><surname>Boudoulas</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Marfan syndrome: abnormal aortic elastic properties</article-title><source>J Am Coll Cardiol</source><year>1991</year><volume>18</volume><fpage>57</fpage><lpage>63</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2050942</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jeremy</surname><given-names>RW</given-names></name><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hwa</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>McCarron</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Hughes</surname><given-names>CF</given-names></name><name><surname>Richards</surname><given-names>JG</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Relation between age, arterial distensibility, and aortic dilatation in the Marfan syndrome</article-title><source>Am J Cardiol</source><year>1994</year><volume>74</volume><fpage>369</fpage><lpage>373</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8059700</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/0002-9149(94)90405-7</pub